// Title: Add Port Monitor Persistence in Registry
// Rule ID: 944e8941-f6f6-4ee8-ac05-1c224e923c0e
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.t1547.010
// Category: registry_set
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/registry/registry_set/registry_set_add_port_monitor.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
